  _lines:
  - _speaker: woodcutter
    _side: 1
    _expression: worried
    _text: Trees aplenty, and nobody left who knows how to drop one safe. My hands
      shake too much now.
    _box: auto
    _point: 
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: 
    _text: "Oh \u2014 let\u2019s set this aside first, and step back out to the kingdom."
    _box: auto
    _point: back
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 17
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: idea
    _text: Then a book will teach them! I have a book for that. I have a book for
      most things.
    _box: auto
    _point: ui:nav:research
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 15
      _target: research
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: idea
    _text: "Each page is a craft Oakville forgot. This one\u2019s Forestry \u2014
      chapter one. My favourite!"
    _box: auto
    _point: ui:tech:Forestry
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 18
      _target: techsheet:Forestry
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: 
    _text: "Learning takes Knowledge \u2014 that\u2019s my studying, bottled up.
      Pour it in\u2026"
    _box: auto
    _point: ui:tech-pour
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 8
      _target: Forestry
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: happy
    _text: "\u2026then a little Gold for proper axes, and the craft is ours again.
      Just like that!"
    _box: auto
    _point: ui:tech-research
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 7
      _target: Forestry
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: happy
    _text: Hear that? Axes in the woods! I study a point of Knowledge an hour, up
      to ten. Best spend it before then.
    _box: auto
    _point: ui:knowledge
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: 
    _text: "Let\u2019s close the book and go and watch them work. I\u2019ll \u2014
      I\u2019ll mark the page."
    _box: auto
    _point: ui:close
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 16
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
